	A young reporter sits across from a man in a flawless black suit. He looks neither young nor old. His face expressionless.

	Reporter: So, Mr. Voss, congratulations on securing the new federal contract!
	Reporter: With national IDs now under HAVEMORE’s management, some say your company is practically running the country.

	CEO Voss: Oh, we don’t run the country.
	CEO Voss: We simply maintain it. The country runs through us.
	do Flags.set_level_flag("tv_examined", true)
else
